{
  "title": "The Greatest Estate Developer",
  "description": "When civil engineering student Su-Ho Kim falls asleep reading a fantasy novel, he wakes up as a character in the book! Su-Ho is now in the body of Lloyd Frontera, a lazy noble who loves to drink, and whose family is in a mountain of debt. Using his engineering knowledge, Su-Ho designs inventions to avert the terrible future that lies in wait for him. With the help of a giant hamster, a knight, and the world’s magic, can Su-Ho dig his new family out of debt and build a better future? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 12 extra chapters.*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Adventure, Agriculture, Animal Companion S, Animals, Arrogant Characters, Aura, Baron/Baroness, Based on a Novel, Bromance, Brown-Haired Male Lead, Brown-Haired Protagonist, Business Management, Butler, Comedic Facial Expressions, Comedic Undertone, Comedy, Construction, Countryside, Cunning Protagonist, Debts, Deceptive Protagonist, Designer, Drama, Elaborate, Elves, Engineering, European Ambience, Facial Expressions, Fallen Nobility, Fantasy, Fast Growth, Game Elements, Greed, Greedy Protagonist, Hard-Working Protagonist, Human-Nonhuman Friendship, Intimidation, Kingdom, Knight, Leadership, Loyal Servant, Magic, Modern Knowledge, Money, Money Grubber, Money Problems, Monsters, Muscles, Muscular Female, Nobility, Non-BL with Two Male Leads, Parody, Politics, Pragmatic Protagonist, Proactive Protagonist, Royalty, Rude Character, Running Gags, Shameless Protagonist, Shounen, Skills, Smart Male Lead, Smart Protagonist, Strong Protagonist, Summoned Creatures, Summoner, System, Transmigration, Transported To a Book World, Transported to Another World, Unattractive Protagonist, Underestimated Protagonist, Absurdity, Advanced Knowledge Meets Archaic World, Anachronism, Annoying Male Lead, Anti-Hero, Assertive Female Lead, Based on a Web Novel, Blackmail, Blushing Character, Centaur, Construction Worker, Crazy Character, Determined Male Lead, Devoted Male Lead, Dwarf, Economics, Europe, Famous Female Lead, Famous Male Lead, Female Empowerment, Female Lead Falls in Love First, Friendship, Full Color, Gaslighting, Hamster, Hated Protagonist, Hell, Heterosexual, Horror, Human-Nonhuman Relationship, Interspecies Relationship, Isekai, Isekai'd Into a Novel, Kind Male Lead, Kingdom Building, Kingdom Management, Lake, Large Cast, Life-Changing Events, Longstrip, Loyal Character, Loyal Male Lead, Loyal Protagonist, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Manhwa, Manipulative Male Lead, Master-Servant Relationship, Middle Eastern, Military, Necromancer, Orc, Personality Change, Petty Protagonist, Politicians, Politics Involving Royalty, Quirky Character, Romantic Subplot, Rural, Ruthless Character, Scary Male Lead, Scary Protagonist, Seeing Things Other Humans Can't, Sharp-Tongued Female Lead, Sharp-Tongued Protagonist, Shovel, Singing, Slapstick, Smart Female Lead, Spanking, Strong Female Lead, Supernatural, Surreal Comedy, Swordplay, Swords, Swordsman, Swordswoman, System Administrator, Teamwork, Teasing Character, Teasing Male Lead, Territory Management, Travel, Ugly Character, Ugly Male Lead, Undead, Unrealistic Fighting, Unusual First Meeting, Village, Violence, Weak to Strong, Web Comic, Workaholic, World Building, Younger Brother, Chimera, Class Struggle, Marriage, Queen, Science Fantasy, Sweet Talker",
